WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:02.115
- So huge news involving Rudy Giuliani.

00:00:02.115 --> 00:00:04.550
Apparently the Department
of Justice has executed

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:06.880
a search warrant and searched his files.

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:08.220
It's hard to overstate

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:11.150
just how extraordinary of a step this is.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.120
The Department of Justice
doesn't like executing

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:14.260
search warrants against lawyers

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:16.950
and especially against
lawyers of a former president.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.070
It was extraordinary when
it happened to Michael Cohen

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:21.010
and it's doubly
extraordinary when it happens

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:21.843
to Rudy Giuliani.

00:00:21.843 --> 00:00:24.131
This is allegedly related
to Giuliani's efforts

00:00:24.131 --> 00:00:27.395
to illegally lobby on behalf of Ukrainians

00:00:27.395 --> 00:00:29.731
and potentially Russians
and surprise surprise,

00:00:29.731 --> 00:00:32.030
there are reports that the Trump DOJ tried

00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:33.357
to quash this investigation

00:00:33.357 --> 00:00:36.291
only to have new Attorney
General Merrick Garland remove

00:00:36.291 --> 00:00:37.520
the objections.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:40.260
Whether this is the start of prosecutions

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:41.810
against former Trump officials

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:45.020
or just something related to
Giuliani remains to be seen,

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:46.753
but we'll see you in court.

